  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Promoting to Farmer for Post Harvesting &amp;amp; Management (Value Addition)&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to encourage all categories of farmers to establish crop value addition units that utilize post-harvesting technology and management strategies.\n",
  "eligibility": "> **Eligible entities:**\n\n\n- Farmers Interest Group\n- Farmers Producer Group\n- Farmer Producer Companies\n- Self-Help Groups (SHGs) and Sakhi Mandals of Women farmers\n- Co-operative society at village level\n\n> **Eligible Individuals with relevant agricultural education:**\n\n\n- Diploma in Agriculture\n- Graduate in Agriculture\n- Postgraduate in Agriculture\n- Bachelor of Rural Studies (B.R.S.)\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
